n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x-6 & =A(x-9)+B.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=9$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(9)-6 & =A(9-9)+B \\\\ 21 & =B.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$ and using our value for $B$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(0)-6 & =A(0-9)+21 \\\\ -6 & =-9A+21 \\\\ 9A & =27 \\\\ A & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nA\\cdot B=3\\cdot 21=63.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73202/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e0d98b82-24d2-5b2c-b596-0300778bd187"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73202"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-351224/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "6a65cae1-5c6e-56cc-9836-cb72e5f4217f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351224/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ed94fcdf-a355-5013-94a2-760efd9ef703" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351224/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer-field/choices ["q-351224/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351224/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "b33aff10-f827-5b37-b3ef-2a4d8ffc7813" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351224/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "0f4bb3f2-b5d7-526e-b3d9-24d34b9f34ef" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351224/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-351224/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351224/field-3/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "3c5b8b53-7f15-5985-a809-68ea10b45cee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351224/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "bfb66f23-f127-5713-90a1-80b89a6eb9e7" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351224/field-3/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-351224/field-3/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351224" :question/id #uuid "95977e79-a0bc-56f1-b58f-a70a42850ef8" :question/math-academy-id "q-351224" :question/problem "Express $\\frac{-18{x}^{2}-44x-38}{(x-1)(2x+3)^{2}}$ as a sum of partial fractions.\n\n| $\\frac{-18{x}^{2}-44x-38}{(x-1)(2x+3)^{2}}\\,=-$ | {{field-1}} | $-$ | {{field-2}} | $+$ | {{field-3}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $x-1$ |  | $2x+3$ |  | $(2x+3)^{2}$ |" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $A,$ $B,$ and $C$ such that\n\n$$\n\\frac{-18{x}^{2}-44x-38}{(x-1)(2x+3)^{2}}=\\frac{A}{x-1}+\\frac{B}{2x+3}+\\frac{C}{(2x+3)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(x-1)(2x+3)^{2}$ gives\n\n$$\n-18{x}^{2}-44x-38=A(2x+3)^{2}+B(x-1)(2x+3)+C(x-1).\n$$\n\nLetting $x=1$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-18(1)^{2}-44(1)-38 & =A(2\\cdot 1+3)^{2}+B(1-1)(2\\cdot 1+3)+C(1-1) \\\\ -100 & =A(5)^{2} \\\\ A & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=-\\frac{3}{2}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-18{(-\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}-44(-\\frac{3}{2})-38 & =A{(2\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{2})+3)}^{2}+B(-\\frac{3}{2}-1)(2\\cdot (-\\frac{3}{2})+3)+C(-\\frac{3}{2}-1) \\\\ -\\frac{25}{2} & =C(-\\frac{5}{2}) \\\\ C & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, letting $x=0$ and using our values for $A$ and $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-18(0)^{2}-44(0)-38 & =A(2\\cdot 0+3)^{2}+B(0-1)(2\\cdot 0+3)+5(0-1) \\\\ -38 & =(-4)(9)+B(-1)(3)-5 \\\\ -38 & =-41-3B \\\\ B & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{-18{x}^{2}-44x-38}{(x-1)(2x+3)^{2}}=-\\,\\frac{4}{x-1}-\\,\\frac{1}{2x+3}+\\frac{5}{(2x+3)^{2}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-351224/field-1" "q-351224/field-2" "q-351224/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c30dc350-d0c9-5a4d-87a0-4e2ebb1bb221"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-351224"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-10995/selection/80b712f4a86913741c2aebe4606470888005662baf6666a55acda3b9125ba65d" :answer/id #uuid "85bd0ae2-c232-59de-ba36-29aff0af88a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{x+7}+\\frac{4}{(x+7)^{2}}+\\frac{2}{x-3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10995/selection/007e8e51685b3ee2d7b397b8ed5be56d7f7e70ac3cb87469fa13a21a7ca7a3f7" :answer/id #uuid "57e31a9b-dd8b-53f6-8829-afbea9fc1114" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{x+7}+\\frac{4}{(x+7)^{2}}-\\frac{4}{x-3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10995/selection/f6450ea2ad73ac9b9508433772b0784ea8eac327831536084e980a4641be268d" :answer/id #uuid "9a00271a-8db0-593f-9aaa-44d018f3fb7d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{x+7}-\\frac{2}{(x+7)^{2}}+\\frac{2}{x-3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10995/selection/fd3100d39a21b36b73987e289c213ea39d4ea5868a1577a2db9f47d7e856c4e5" :answer/id #uuid "fb2bd00f-1d2a-598f-b671-3c003919eb3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{6}{x+7}+\\frac{4}{(x+7)^{2}}+\\frac{2}{x-3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10995/selection/86d204e8905bd77fdf1d7dfb146aeb38dfff7df90faa3bc569399d3b0eb7fe3b" :answer/id #uuid "4a63cd5f-ec2f-5999-ae66-889ffbc2e1ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{6}{x+7}-\\frac{2}{(x+7)^{2}}-\\frac{4}{x-3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10995/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "86877b93-522a-516a-89ef-6a418b81c5cf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-10995/selection/80b712f4a86913741c2aebe4606470888005662baf6666a55acda3b9125ba65d" :answer-field/choices ["q-10995/selection/80b712f4a86913741c2aebe4606470888005662baf6666a55acda3b9125ba65d" "q-10995/selection/007e8e51685b3ee2d7b397b8ed5be56d7f7e70ac3cb87469fa13a21a7ca7a3f7" "q-10995/selection/f6450ea2ad73ac9b9508433772b0784ea8eac327831536084e980a4641be268d" "q-10995/selection/fd3100d39a21b36b73987e289c213ea39d4ea5868a1577a2db9f47d7e856c4e5" "q-10995/selection/86d204e8905bd77fdf1d7dfb146aeb38dfff7df90faa3bc569399d3b0eb7fe3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-10995" :question/id #uuid "562093a1-82de-5994-a12f-6e3f2d1e1558" :question/math-academy-id "q-10995" :question/problem "Express $\\frac{-{x}^{2}+20x+149}{(x+7)^{2}(x-3)}$ as a sum of partial     fractions." :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $A,$ $B$ and $C$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-{x}^{2}+20x+149}{(x+7)^{2}(x-3)} & =\\frac{A}{x+7}+\\frac{B}{(x+7)^{2}}+\\frac{C}{x-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(x+7)^{2}(x-3)$ gives\n\n$$\n-{x}^{2}+20x+149=A(x+7)(x-3)+B(x-3)+C(x+7)^{2}.\n$$\n\nFor $x=-7$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-(-7)^{2}+20(-7)+149 & =A(-7+7)(-7-3)+B(-7-3)+C(-7+7)^{2} \\\\ -49-140+149 & =B(-10) \\\\ B & =\\frac{-40}{-10} \\\\ B & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=3$, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-(3)^{2}+20(3)+149 & =A(3+7)(3-3)+B(3-3)+C(3+7)^{2} \\\\ -9+60+149 & =C{(10)}^{2} \\\\ C & =\\frac{200}{100} \\\\ C & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=0$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-({0}^{2})+20(0)+149 & =A(0+7)(0-3)+B(0-3)+C(0+7)^{2} \\\\ 149 & =-21A-3B+49C \\\\ 149 & =-21A-3(4)+49(2) \\\\ 149 & =-21A+86 \\\\ 21A & =-63 \\\\ A & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\frac{-{x}^{2}+20x+149}{(x+7)^{2}(x-3)}=-\\frac{3}{x+7}+\\frac{4}{(x+7)^{2}}+\\frac{2}{x-3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-10995/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c30dc350-d0c9-5a4d-87a0-4e2ebb1bb221"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10995"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-10993/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "27412ca7-6d8c-551b-b118-50ba6c97d471" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10993/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" :answer/id #uuid "27c5c222-355d-57d5-af3f-5643dfc0b9ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10993/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "569304e4-bcd0-5079-a323-4c6806fa8522" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10993/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "87f61b80-5352-5bfb-acad-74e1e28c82f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10993/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "6057d347-e114-5d79-90e8-f96e5e115906" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-10993/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f206e28-2cd6-59fc-9163-1ead81cfce9d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-10993/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" :answer-field/choices ["q-10993/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" "q-10993/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" "q-10993/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" "q-10993/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-10993/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-10993" :question/id #uuid "fe6bc6b2-502d-58e9-96c1-e7cee67c2b89" :question/math-academy-id "q-10993" :question/problem "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}-9x+21}{(x-4)^{2}(3-x)}=\\frac{A}{x-4}+\\frac{B}{(x-4)^{2}}+\\frac{C}{3-x},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$, and $C$ are real constants, determine the value of $A\\cdot B\\cdot C.$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying both sides by $(x-4)^{2}(3-x)$ gives\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}-9x+21=A(x-4)(3-x)+B(3-x)+C(x-4)^{2}.\n$$\n\nLetting $x=4$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{4}^{2}-9(4)+21 & =A(4-4)(3-4)+B(3-4)+C(4-4)^{2} \\\\ 16-36+21 & =B(-1) \\\\ 1 & =-B \\\\ B & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=3$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{3}^{2}-9(3)+21 & =A(3-4)(3-3)+B(3-3)+C(3-4)^{2} \\\\ 9-27+21 & =C{(-1)}^{2} \\\\ C & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, letting $x=0$ and using our values for $B$ and $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0}^{2}-9(0)+21 & =A(0-4)(3-0)+(-1)(3-0)+3(0-4)^{2} \\\\ 21 & =-12A-3+48 \\\\ 21 & =-12A+45 \\\\ 12A & =24 \\\\ A & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\nA\\cdot B\\cdot C=2\\cdot (-1)\\cdot 3=-6.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-10993/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c30dc350-d0c9-5a4d-87a0-4e2ebb1bb221"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10993"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-351215/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "60c6ba72-3c02-5e48-966c-3f177c42697b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351215/field-1/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "26bda1d5-c493-576b-a206-2ecdce39aad2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351215/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "749b5a75-54b7-5872-a72c-2467985218e8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "