d-solution "Our task is to find $A,$ $B,$ and $C$ such that\n\n$$\n\\frac{7{x}^{2}-18x+12}{x(x-2)^{2}}=\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{B}{x-2}+\\frac{C}{(x-2)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $x(x-2)^{2}$ gives\n\n$$\n7{x}^{2}-18x+12=A(x-2)^{2}+Bx(x-2)+Cx.\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(0)^{2}-18(0)+12 & =A(0-2)^{2}+B(0)(0-2)+C(0) \\\\ 12 & =A(-2)^{2} \\\\ 12 & =4A \\\\ A & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=2$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(2)^{2}-18(2)+12 & =A(2-2)^{2}+B(2)(2-2)+C(2) \\\\ 4 & =C(2) \\\\ 4 & =2C \\\\ C & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, letting $x=1$ and using our values for $A$ and $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(1)^{2}-18(1)+12 & =3(1-2)^{2}+B(1)(1-2)+2(1) \\\\ 1 & =3(-1)^{2}+B(-1)+2 \\\\ 1 & =3-B+2 \\\\ 1 & =5-B \\\\ B & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\frac{7{x}^{2}-18x+12}{x(x-2)^{2}}=\\frac{3}{x}+\\frac{4}{x-2}+\\frac{2}{(x-2)^{2}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-351215/field-1" "q-351215/field-2" "q-351215/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c30dc350-d0c9-5a4d-87a0-4e2ebb1bb221"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-351215"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-51141/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "b013c49a-7235-534b-95cb-e6ec7aed0156" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51141/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer/id #uuid "2949d997-b7df-5136-ab3e-d8d1234ea639" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51141/selection/34d6a116cfea25ad11008d41d6152ee565691a4dc671039515875488f5520d96" :answer/id #uuid "c1337fa2-6a85-5185-841d-9b62fa9933dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51141/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer/id #uuid "cebf97f7-73e5-579b-8173-2cc90559fbdd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51141/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "98ec2afa-d2d1-52d4-a6e4-7e098d49502a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-51141/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1a5d8a44-e752-5b69-8903-594e4b8dff2d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-51141/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer-field/choices ["q-51141/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" "q-51141/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" "q-51141/selection/34d6a116cfea25ad11008d41d6152ee565691a4dc671039515875488f5520d96" "q-51141/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" "q-51141/selection/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-51141" :question/id #uuid "02be96e1-29ee-55e3-9149-ea13abece695" :question/math-academy-id "q-51141" :question/problem "Given that \n\n$$\n\\frac{2x+6}{(x-1)^{2}(x+1)}=\\frac{A}{x-1}+\\frac{B}{(x-1)^{2}}+\\frac{C}{x+1},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$, and $C$ are real constants, determine the value of $A\\cdot B\\cdot C.$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $(x-1)^{2}(x+1)$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x+6=A(x-1)(x+1)+B(x+1)+C(x-1)^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=-1$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(-1)+6 & =A(-1-1)(-1+1)+B(-1+1)+C(-1-1)^{2} \\\\ 4 & =4C \\\\ C & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=1$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(1)+6 & =A(1-1)(1+1)+B(1+1)+C(1-1)^{2} \\\\ 8 & =2B \\\\ B & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, letting $x=0$ and using our values for $B$ and $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(0)+6 & =A(0-1)(0+1)+4(0+1)+1(0-1)^{2} \\\\ 6 & =-A+4+1 \\\\ A & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nHence,\n\n$$\nA\\cdot B\\cdot C=(-1)\\cdot 4\\cdot 1=-4.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-51141/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c30dc350-d0c9-5a4d-87a0-4e2ebb1bb221"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-51141"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73384/selection/faf6532f0d4ab903ddc295ac11018acfd3bce2ae030f3f2eed578181eeb5e5e5" :answer/id #uuid "33f19410-c93a-5058-aa74-c618d960484b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-48" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73384/selection/d6944c4d51ee6e8916d5e2815a8478bad91a2f9e9e9bcd499b503b9fbcb165ab" :answer/id #uuid "1954bb96-9ae7-5fba-867f-c1b6df38dd80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "54" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73384/selection/5cd5dc93f37c743976373ab57c37b5388ba149bd286c5b2139ed2c89c249424d" :answer/id #uuid "8cf9df0f-763c-555a-a335-1dc78876db06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-36" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73384/selection/a20b3c9808c291c56ec5bfc5f0f93a856fc692714ca7ebd36c5e4bc361f7075c" :answer/id #uuid "c90ae67a-bc9f-5e88-becf-5ccc3fd0d8de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73384/selection/ce9ad5740269388d77893fbd186fe766ceb1482af44117dcfc7940e9dca5a239" :answer/id #uuid "d2197e47-1c94-5019-b985-e3bf921829dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73384/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "772eafbb-edcf-572d-96fc-b5dfcb9333da" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73384/selection/faf6532f0d4ab903ddc295ac11018acfd3bce2ae030f3f2eed578181eeb5e5e5" :answer-field/choices ["q-73384/selection/faf6532f0d4ab903ddc295ac11018acfd3bce2ae030f3f2eed578181eeb5e5e5" "q-73384/selection/d6944c4d51ee6e8916d5e2815a8478bad91a2f9e9e9bcd499b503b9fbcb165ab" "q-73384/selection/5cd5dc93f37c743976373ab57c37b5388ba149bd286c5b2139ed2c89c249424d" "q-73384/selection/a20b3c9808c291c56ec5bfc5f0f93a856fc692714ca7ebd36c5e4bc361f7075c" "q-73384/selection/ce9ad5740269388d77893fbd186fe766ceb1482af44117dcfc7940e9dca5a239"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73384" :question/id #uuid "0db90aa3-80f4-55c5-ba22-802ee679163a" :question/math-academy-id "q-73384" :question/problem "Given that \n\n$$\n\\frac{10-{x}^{2}}{(x-4)^{3}}=\\frac{A}{x-4}+\\frac{B}{(x-4)^{2}}+\\frac{C}{(x-4)^{3}},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$ and $C$ are real constants, find the value of $A\\cdot B\\cdot C.$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $(x-4)^{3}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10-{x}^{2} & =A(x-4)^{2}+B(x-4)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=4$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10-{4}^{2} & =A(4-4)^{2}+B(4-4)+C \\\\ -6 & =A(0)+B(0)+C \\\\ C & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$ and using our value for $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10-{0}^{2} & =A(0-4)^{2}+B(0-4)-6 \\\\ 10 & =16A-4B-6 \\\\ 0 & =16A-4B-16 \\\\ 0 & =4A-B-4 \\\\ B & =4A-4.\\,\\,(1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, letting $x=3$ and using our value for $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10-{3}^{2} & =A(3-4)^{2}+B(3-4)-6 \\\\ 1 & =A-B-6 \\\\ 0 & =A-B-7 \\\\ B & =A-7.\\,\\,(2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom $(1)$ and $(2)$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4A-4 & =A-7 \\\\ 3A & =-3 \\\\ A & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we substitute the value of $A$ into $(2)$  to get the value of $B:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B & =-1-7=-8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A\\cdot B\\cdot C & =-1\\cdot (-8)\\cdot (-6)=-48.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73384/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9e9c4ef2-0491-5b42-8679-4fe7dfbd7b00"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73384"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-351243/field-1/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "fb4914a0-dcac-553b-a9c1-6e6174cafe91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351243/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "cba7ad19-e9f0-5861-a329-d1b9a37ee778" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351243/field-1/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer-field/choices ["q-351243/field-1/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351243/field-2/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "75a23c48-9a8f-566e-b0c3-fec4d39fbacd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351243/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "8394f092-b34a-51bf-a410-97a0251f5a10" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351243/field-2/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer-field/choices ["q-351243/field-2/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351243/field-3/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "6d73c11d-74d9-53f9-8208-cc2720a8385c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-351243/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "5ad10d37-524f-53f8-ba9d-3f87a9a80ee0" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-351243/field-3/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer-field/choices ["q-351243/field-3/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-351243" :question/id #uuid "abf4a0bc-708c-5fd0-8c3f-6225acfa1d94" :question/math-academy-id "q-351243" :question/problem "Express $\\frac{7{x}^{2}-32x+42}{(x-2)^{3}}$ as a sum of partial fractions.\n\n| $\\frac{7{x}^{2}-32x+42}{(x-2)^{3}}\\,=$ | {{field-1}} | $-$ | {{field-2}} | $+$ | {{field-3}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $x-2$ |  | $(x-2)^{2}$ |  | $(x-2)^{3}$ |" :question/worked-solution "Our task is to find $A,$ $B,$ and $C$ such that\n\n$$\n\\frac{7{x}^{2}-32x+42}{(x-2)^{3}}=\\frac{A}{x-2}+\\frac{B}{(x-2)^{2}}+\\frac{C}{(x-2)^{3}}.\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(x-2)^{3}$ gives\n\n$$\n7{x}^{2}-32x+42=A(x-2)^{2}+B(x-2)+C.\n$$\n\nLetting $x=2$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(2)^{2}-32(2)+42 & =A(2-2)^{2}+B(2-2)+C \\\\ 6 & =C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=3$ and using our value for $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(3)^{2}-32(3)+42 & =A(3-2)^{2}+B(3-2)+6 \\\\ 9 & =A+B+6 \\\\ B & =3-A.\\,\\,(1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, letting $x=0$ and using our value for $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7(0)^{2}-32(0)+42 & =A(0-2)^{2}+B(0-2)+6 \\\\ 42 & =4A-2B+6 \\\\ 36 & =4A-2B \\\\ B & =2A-18.\\,\\,(2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom $(1)$ and $(2)$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3-A & =2A-18 \\\\ A & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we substitute the value of $A$ into $(1)$ to get the value of $B:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B & =3-7 \\\\ B & =-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\frac{7{x}^{2}-32x+42}{(x-2)^{3}}=\\frac{7}{x-2}-\\frac{4}{(x-2)^{2}}+\\frac{6}{(x-2)^{3}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-351243/field-1" "q-351243/field-2" "q-351243/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9e9c4ef2-0491-5b42-8679-4fe7dfbd7b00"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-351243"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-115214/selection/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" :answer/id #uuid "41551250-7053-5ab8-a51a-f5a1b1c226d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115214/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "e24c90b4-72c1-5f45-8f41-49b8064ae185" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115214/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "a98ccb93-6c23-5674-a49c-9eac7da199b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115214/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "5a87d9cb-6d60-5b4f-a113-4d0b6f67b391" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115214/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" :answer/id #uuid "46690450-110d-5714-a897-ba1c65533cfb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115214/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ba3faba9-44c2-516c-b9be-83edcb80ec11" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-115214/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer-field/choices ["q-115214/selection/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" "q-115214/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-115214/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-115214/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" "q-115214/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-115214" :question/id #uuid "293e8929-b418-51e0-a83a-fc43f7e0416b" :question/math-academy-id "q-115214" :question/problem "Given that \n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}-6x+9}{(x-2)^{3}}=\\frac{A}{x-2}+\\frac{B}{(x-2)^{2}}+\\frac{C}{(x-2)^{3}},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$ and $C$ are real constants, find the value of $A\\cdot B\\cdot C.$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $(x-2)^{3}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}-6x+9 & =A(x-2)^{2}+B(x-2)+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=2$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2}^{2}-6(2)+9 & =A(2-2)^{2}+B(2-2)+C \\\\ 1 & =A(0)+B(0)+C \\\\ C & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$ and using our value for $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0}^{2}-6(0)+9 & =A(0-2)^{2}+B(0-2)+1 \\\\ 9 & =4A-2B+1 \\\\ 0 & =4A-2B-8 \\\\ 0 & =2A-B-4 \\\\ B & =2A-4.\\,\\,(1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, letting $x=1$ and using our value for $C$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{1}^{2}-6(1)+9 & =A(1-2)^{2}+B(1-2)+1 \\\\ 4 & =A-B+1 \\\\ 0 & =A-B-3 \\\\ B & =A-3.\\,\\,(2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom $(1)$ and $(2)$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2A-4 & =A-3 \\\\ 2A-A & =-3+4 \\\\ A & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we substitute the value of $A$ into $(2)$  to get the value of $B:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B & =A-3=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A\\cdot B\\cdot C & =1\\cdot (-2)\\cdot 1=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-115214/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9e9c4ef2-0491-5b42-8679-4fe7dfbd7b00"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-115214"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-115238/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "46b5afeb-97e3-546e-9836-a517479ec1df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115238/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "5b52f966-e10f-533e-b4db-8a3f4efd5c19" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115238/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "d854b1a7-d75c-563a-8e95-2c76f8c527e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115238/selection/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" :answer/id #uuid "6e0dbd01-f32a-507d-95b3-24e4669d4eb9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115238/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "d484a632-80ce-5061-ab02-ef7c9d2e8ecb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115238/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "cce54225-585f-5c7c-8a6a-837c9b1c837f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-115238/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-115238/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" "q-115238/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-115238/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-115238/selection/25666b67a56594dd5245ec05e89d883db07d04362ab51dbc90c39ad20f7f9142" "q-115238/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-115238" :question/id #uuid "4b277ff2-a2f0-5aae-ae88-3cd92c483fac" :question/math-academy-id "q-115238" :question/problem "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}+17x+8}{x(x+2)^{3}}=\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{B}{x+2}+\\frac{C}{(x+2)^{2}}+\\frac{D}{(x+2)^{3}},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$, $C$ and $D$ are real constants, determine the value of $AB+CD.$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $x(x+2)^{3}$ gives\n\n$$\n{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}+17x+8=A(x+2)^{3}+Bx(x+2)^{2}+Cx(x+2)+Dx.\n$$\n\nLetting $x=-2$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-2)^{3}+8(-2)^{2}+17(-2)+8 & =A(-2+2)^{3}+B(-2)(-2+2)^{2}+C(-2)(-2+2)+D(-2) \\\\ -8+32-34+8 & =-2D \\\\ -8+32-34+8 & =-2D \\\\ -2 & =-2D \\\\ D & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0}^{3}+8(0)^{2}+17(0)+8 & =A(0+2)^{3}+B(0)(0+2)^{2}+C(0)(0+2)+D(0) \\\\ 8 & =8A \\\\ A & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=-1$ and using our values for $A$ and $D$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-1)^{3}+8(-1)^{2}+17(-1)+8 & =1(-1+2)^{3}+B(-1)(-1+2)^{2}+C(-1)(-1+2)+1(-1) \\\\ -1+8-17+8 & =1-B-C-1 \\\\ B & =2-C.\\,\\,(1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, letting $x=-3$ and using our values for $A$ and $D$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-3)^{3}+8(-3)^{2}+17(-3)+8 & =1(-3+2)^{3}+B(-3)(-3+2)^{2}+C(-3)(-3+2)+1(-3) \\\\ -27+72-51+8 & =-1-3B+3C-3 \\\\ 3B & =3C-6 \\\\ B & =C-2.\\,\\,(2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom $(1)$ and $(2)$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2-C & =C-2 \\\\ -2C & =-4 \\\\ C & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we substitute the value of $C$ into $(1)$  to get the value of $B:$\n\n$$\nB=2-2=0\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nAB+CD=1(0)+2(1)=2.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-115238/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9e9c4ef2-0491-5b42-8679-4fe7dfbd7b00"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-115238"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-115249/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "9545dcc6-c087-5a83-93de-2a2f2299a41d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115249/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "847c8fa0-b825-5394-9508-44a61d882310" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115249/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "6639cb7f-c400-5ba0-a281-84a83db8351d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115249/selection/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" :answer/id #uuid "46e816e0-2e26-5993-8404-1c6d8cd7aa19" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115249/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "633a86f6-02ee-5ee1-8ecb-8f4e91106009" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115249/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "84d2d005-2859-5bfb-9036-80fb6ce79b8f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-115249/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer-field/choices ["q-115249/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" "q-115249/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" "q-115249/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" "q-115249/selection/10293ac0295e0e79554137a949f5c5c46b9812dcc0a3ecb6349c4cb5e6acdff3" "q-115249/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-115249" :question/id #uuid "ebb07e93-fdbe-5228-b512-65a84db28615" :question/math-academy-id "q-115249" :question/problem "Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{2x+1}{(x-1)(x-2)^{3}}=\\frac{A}{x-1}+\\frac{B}{x-2}+\\frac{C}{(x-2)^{2}}+\\frac{D}{(x-2)^{3}},\n$$\n\nwhere $A$, $B$, $C$ and $D$ are real constants, determine the value of $AB-CD.$" :question/worked-solution "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $(x-1)(x-2)^{3}$ to give\n\n$$\n2x+1=A(x-2)^{3}+B(x-1)(x-2)^{2}+C(x-1)(x-2)+D(x-1).\n$$\n\nLetting $x=2$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(2)+1 & =A(2-2)^{3}+B(2-1)(2-2)^{2}+C(2-1)(2-2)+D(2-1) \\\\ 4+1 & =D \\\\ D & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=1$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(1)+1 & =A(1-2)^{3}+B(1-1)(1-2)^{2}+C(1-1)(1-2)+D(1-1) \\\\ 2+1 & =-A \\\\ A & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$ and using our values for $A$ and $D$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(0)+1 & =-3(0-2)^{3}+B(0-1)(0-2)^{2}+C(0-1)(0-2)+5(0-1) \\\\ 0+1 & =24-4B+2C-5 \\\\ 2C & =4B-18 \\\\ C & =2B-9.\\,\\,(1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, letting $x=3$ and using our values for $A$ and $D$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(3)+1 & =-3(3-2)^{3}+B(3-1)(3-2)^{2}+C(3-1)(3-2)+5(3-1) \\\\ 6+1 & =-3+2B+2C+10 \\\\ 2C & =-2B \\\\ C & =-B.\\,\\,(2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom $(1)$ and $(2)$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2B-9 & =-B \\\\ 3B & =9 \\\\ B & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we substitute the value of $B$ into $(2)$  to get the value of $C:$\n\n$$\nC=-3\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nAB-CD=-3(3)-(-3)(5)=6.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-115249/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9e9c4ef2-0491-5b42-8679-4fe7dfbd7b00"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-115249"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
